    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d243">

                <pb facs="0318" n="234" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg234"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ehrman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-07"><hi rendition="#italic">November 7,
                        1903</hi>.</date><lb/>(Received 12.20 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have communicated to Panama Government that they will be held responsible for
                    the protection of the persons and property of citizens of the United States, as
                    well as to keep the isthmian transit free in accordance with obligations of
                    existing treaties relative to the isthmian territory.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ehrman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
